{% include '_header.html.liquid', emailTitle: "Your account was recovered with the recovery phrase" %}
<p style="margin:0 0 16px">Someone signed in to your {{ appName }} account, proved possession of the recovery phrase and set a new password and a new Secret Key.</p>
<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width:100%;margin:0 0 20px;background:#fbeaea;border:1px solid #f3caca;border-radius:8px">
  <tr><td style="padding:16px;font-size:14px;color:#7a1f1f">
    <p style="margin:0 0 6px"><strong>Recovered at:</strong> {{ occurredAt }}</p>
    <p style="margin:0"><strong>Client:</strong> {{ client }}</p>
  </td></tr>
</table>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px">All other sessions were signed out. Devices that still hold the old Secret Key cannot sign in until they receive the new one.</p>
<p style="margin:0">If this was you, keep the new Emergency Kit and the new recovery phrase in a safe place. If it was not you, contact {{ supportEmail }} immediately.</p>
